    "detailed_description": "<h1>DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/77610ac27856ac76bbfe11144a95d103.avif?t=1749123427\" width=750 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord community and get more events\u00a0 details in group! \u2694 Find the Discord link in the sidebar.</p></p><br><h1>Download the Full Version</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search &quot;Pixel Dungeon VR&quot; and add the full version to your cart!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/1a70f047b7a382818ae8ac1d6bce21c6.poster.avif?t=1749123427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/1a70f047b7a382818ae8ac1d6bce21c6.webm?t=1749123427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/8c37e05d02850cf6dd9c08034840ae5f.avif?t=1749123427\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>With core gameplay of Dungeons of Eternity &amp; Ancient Dungeon, upgrade Battle Talent's combat thrills, this co-op game brings you into VR Minecraft world to explore the unknown\uff01</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get full game Pixel Dungeon VR to unlock more maps &amp; content and be ready for more epic dungeon adventures!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5Boss Fight, Awesome Every Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skull King</strong> swings his axe, little skulls run to attack you. <strong>Ghost Lord</strong> blows things up &amp; shoots bullets to chase you! <strong>Angel</strong> turns into giant eye monster &amp; fires lasers everywhere. <strong>God of Time</strong> smashes the ground &amp; throws everyone into 2nd battleground - battles get more exciting! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/6c786f456494b46224b6ffdd96523310.poster.avif?t=1749123427\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/6c786f456494b46224b6ffdd96523310.webm?t=1749123427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/6c786f456494b46224b6ffdd96523310.mp4?t=1749123427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0fRich Weapons, Always Something New</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw <strong>Captain America's shield</strong> to hit enemies! Use <strong>Wolverine's claws</strong> to tear up monsters! Become <strong>Hawkeye, shoot with longbow</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find a treasure box? Hurry!</strong> Open it for rare weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level up your gear!</strong> 2 stars to 3 stars? Damage doubles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/acec53cb10f643caf0fe06a2b64443c9.poster.avif?t=1749123427\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/acec53cb10f643caf0fe06a2b64443c9.webm?t=1749123427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/acec53cb10f643caf0fe06a2b64443c9.mp4?t=1749123427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc51Tons of Hero Looks, Customize Yours!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Witcher, Black Knight, Bird Man</strong>...so many heroes to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock skin rewards</strong> - who says you can't look cool in dungeons?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/b496b5d888eff3fa9caa8e074de3c44c.poster.avif?t=1749123427\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/b496b5d888eff3fa9caa8e074de3c44c.webm?t=1749123427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/b496b5d888eff3fa9caa8e074de3c44c.mp4?t=1749123427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728Free Version - Still Fun!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random maps</strong> every time! <strong>Explore freely like Minecraft</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with friends!</strong> Fight monsters together - super exciting! Rock-paper-scissors in the dungeon? - have tons of laughs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich scenes</strong>: Forbidden library, creepy prison, old ruins...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talent tree</strong>: Fast dodges or huge damage attacks, learn new skills every time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster chaos</strong>: Cute slimes bounce, scary skeletons laugh, and spiders crawl\u2014 crush their nests fast!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/3fab8c74865efec560eab3066c651e32.poster.avif?t=1749123427\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/3fab8c74865efec560eab3066c651e32.webm?t=1749123427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/3fab8c74865efec560eab3066c651e32.mp4?t=1749123427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/8c37e05d02850cf6dd9c08034840ae5f.avif?t=1749123427\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>With core gameplay of Dungeons of Eternity &amp; Ancient Dungeon, upgrade Battle Talent's combat thrills, this co-op game brings you into VR Minecraft world to explore the unknown\uff01</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get full game Pixel Dungeon VR to unlock more maps &amp; content and be ready for more epic dungeon adventures!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5Boss Fight, Awesome Every Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skull King</strong> swings his axe, little skulls run to attack you. <strong>Ghost Lord</strong> blows things up &amp; shoots bullets to chase you! <strong>Angel</strong> turns into giant eye monster &amp; fires lasers everywhere. <strong>God of Time</strong> smashes the ground &amp; throws everyone into 2nd battleground - battles get more exciting! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/6c786f456494b46224b6ffdd96523310.poster.avif?t=1749123427\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/6c786f456494b46224b6ffdd96523310.webm?t=1749123427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/6c786f456494b46224b6ffdd96523310.mp4?t=1749123427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0fRich Weapons, Always Something New</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw <strong>Captain America's shield</strong> to hit enemies! Use <strong>Wolverine's claws</strong> to tear up monsters! Become <strong>Hawkeye, shoot with longbow</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find a treasure box? Hurry!</strong> Open it for rare weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level up your gear!</strong> 2 stars to 3 stars? Damage doubles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/acec53cb10f643caf0fe06a2b64443c9.poster.avif?t=1749123427\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/acec53cb10f643caf0fe06a2b64443c9.webm?t=1749123427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/acec53cb10f643caf0fe06a2b64443c9.mp4?t=1749123427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc51Tons of Hero Looks, Customize Yours!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Witcher, Black Knight, Bird Man</strong>...so many heroes to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock skin rewards</strong> - who says you can't look cool in dungeons?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/b496b5d888eff3fa9caa8e074de3c44c.poster.avif?t=1749123427\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/b496b5d888eff3fa9caa8e074de3c44c.webm?t=1749123427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/b496b5d888eff3fa9caa8e074de3c44c.mp4?t=1749123427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728Free Version - Still Fun!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random maps</strong> every time! <strong>Explore freely like Minecraft</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with friends!</strong> Fight monsters together - super exciting! Rock-paper-scissors in the dungeon? - have tons of laughs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich scenes</strong>: Forbidden library, creepy prison, old ruins...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talent tree</strong>: Fast dodges or huge damage attacks, learn new skills every time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster chaos</strong>: Cute slimes bounce, scary skeletons laugh, and spiders crawl\u2014 crush their nests fast!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/3fab8c74865efec560eab3066c651e32.poster.avif?t=1749123427\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/3fab8c74865efec560eab3066c651e32.webm?t=1749123427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/3fab8c74865efec560eab3066c651e32.mp4?t=1749123427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
